# scripts/probe_section9.py writes these beside its manifest on every run. They are
# per-case dumps that reproduce docs/research/section9_adversarial/artifacts/'s own, so
# they are not committed - and without this file every gate-2 run leaves the working tree
# dirty. Four explicit entries, no wildcard: manifest.json, run.log and results.csv are
# the committed evidence that the gate passed and must never be ignored.
RESULTS.md
results.json
full_cards/
section9_outputs/
